{"id":"35044454ad233373","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-gaussian-process.md","title":"Gaussian Process","display":"df-gaussian-process — Gaussian Process","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-gaussian-process","aliases":["58-df-gaussian-process","Gaussian Process"],"display":"df-gaussian-process — Gaussian Process","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-characteristic-function.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-exponential.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-gaussian-process"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-gaussian-process</span><span>Gaussian Process</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gaussian-process — Gaussian Process"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b5f77bed7dfe3f07\" href=\"?note=b5f77bed7dfe3f07\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md\">../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"084076b1e347ab30\" href=\"?note=084076b1e347ab30\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-characteristic-function.md\">../batch20/58-df-characteristic-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"689fa138a0ce2d6c\" href=\"?note=689fa138a0ce2d6c\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-exponential.md\">../batch19/58-df-exponential.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mu,K\\in V\">\\(X,T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mu,K\\in V\\)</span> (process data)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StochProc}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{StochProc}_S\\)</span> (stochastic-process predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b5f77bed7dfe3f07\" href=\"?note=b5f77bed7dfe3f07\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md\">../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CharacteristicFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CharacteristicFunction}_S\\)</span> (特征函数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"084076b1e347ab30\" href=\"?note=084076b1e347ab30\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-characteristic-function.md\">../batch20/58-df-characteristic-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exp\">\\(\\exp\\)</span> (复指数函数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"689fa138a0ce2d6c\" href=\"?note=689fa138a0ce2d6c\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-exponential.md\">../batch19/58-df-exponential.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu:T\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mu:T\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K:T\\times T\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(K:T\\times T\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span> (有限维高斯律中的均值函数与协方差核参数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GaussianProcess}_S\\subseteq V^7\\cup V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{GaussianProcess}_S\\subseteq V^7\\cup V^4\\)</span> (explicit predicate and compatibility form)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gaussian\\text{-}process}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GaussianProcess}_S(X,T,\\mu,K,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{StochProc}_S(X,T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mu,T,\\mathbb R)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(K,T\\times T,\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall\\vec t\\in T^n\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\\left(\n\\exists Y,\\phi\\;\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Function}(Y,\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\Omega\\;Y(\\xi)=\\sum_{j&lt;n}a(j)X(\\vec t(j))(\\xi)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{CharacteristicFunction}_S(\\phi,Y;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\phi(1)=\\exp\\!\\left(i\\sum_{j&lt;n}a(j)\\mu(\\vec t(j))\n-\\frac12\\sum_{j,k&lt;n}a(j)a(k)K(\\vec t(j),\\vec t(k))\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gaussian\\text{-}process}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GaussianProcess}_S(X,T,\\mu,K,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{StochProc}_S(X,T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mu,T,\\mathbb R)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(K,T\\times T,\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall\\vec t\\in T^n\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\\left(\n\\exists Y,\\phi\\;\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Function}(Y,\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\Omega\\;Y(\\xi)=\\sum_{j&lt;n}a(j)X(\\vec t(j))(\\xi)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{CharacteristicFunction}_S(\\phi,Y;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\phi(1)=\\exp\\!\\left(i\\sum_{j&lt;n}a(j)\\mu(\\vec t(j))\n-\\frac12\\sum_{j,k&lt;n}a(j)a(k)K(\\vec t(j),\\vec t(k))\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gaussian\\text{-}process\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GaussianProcess}_S(X,T,\\mu,K)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\;\n\\mathrm{GaussianProcess}_S(X,T,\\mu,K,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gaussian\\text{-}process\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GaussianProcess}_S(X,T,\\mu,K)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\;\n\\mathrm{GaussianProcess}_S(X,T,\\mu,K,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>对每个有限线性组合显式构造实随机变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> 及其特征函数，避免把未定义的“复值期望”直接当作原语。</li>\n<li>Characteristic-function form includes singular finite-dimensional Gaussian laws, so repeated indices and deterministic Gaussian processes are not incorrectly excluded. 由于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 任意，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi(1)\">\\(\\phi(1)\\)</span> 的条件同时覆盖该线性组合特征函数的全部实参数。</li>\n<li>Brownian motion is Gaussian</li>\n<li>Karhunen-Loève: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^2\">\\(L^2\\)</span> expansion via eigenfunctions of covariance</li>\n<li>Conditional distribution: also Gaussian with explicit mean and variance</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Williams and Hazewinkel, Gaussian Random Processes</li>\n<li>Adler and Taylor, Random Fields and Geometry</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md","status":"resolved","id":"b5f77bed7dfe3f07","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-characteristic-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"084076b1e347ab30","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-characteristic-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-exponential.md","status":"resolved","id":"689fa138a0ce2d6c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-exponential.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md","status":"resolved","id":"b5f77bed7dfe3f07","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StochProc}_S$ (stochastic-process predicate, see [[../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-characteristic-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"084076b1e347ab30","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CharacteristicFunction}_S$ (特征函数谓词, see [[../batch20/58-df-characteristic-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-exponential.md","status":"resolved","id":"689fa138a0ce2d6c","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\exp$ (复指数函数, see [[../batch19/58-df-exponential.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mu,K\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StochProc}_S","display":false},{"t